            0.171
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "content": "附录 H 精选读物和网上资源"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.231,
            0.946,
            0.267
          ],
          "content": "有很多有关 $\\mathrm{C}++$ 和编程的优秀图书和网上资源。下述清单只是其中的一些代表作而不是全部，因此还有很多优秀的图书和网站这里没有列出；然后该清单确实具有广泛的代表性。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.295,
            0.322,
            0.316
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "H.1 精选读物"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.141,
            0.343,
            0.95,
            0.437
          ],
          "sub_type": "ref_text",
          "content": "- Becker, Pete. The C++ Standard Library Extensions. Upper Saddle River, NJ: Addison-Wesley, 2007.\n本书讨论第一个TR1（Technical Report）库。这是一个可选的C++98库，但C++11包含其大部分元素。\n涉及的主题包括无序集合模板、智能指针、正则表达式库、随机数库和元组。\n- Booch, Grady, Robert A. Maksimchuk, Michael W. Engel, and Bobbi J. Young. Object-Oriented Analysis and Design, Third Edition. Upper Saddle River, NJ: Addison-Wesley, 2007."
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.438,
            0.902,
            0.455
          ],
          "content": "本书介绍了 OOP 概念，讨论了 OOP 方法，并提供一些示例应用程序，示例是使用 C++ 编写的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.457,
            0.945,
            0.492
          ],
          "content": "- Cline, Marshall, Greg Lomow and Mike Girou. C++FAQ, Second Edition (C++常见问题解答，第二版)。Reading, MA: Addison-Wesley, 1998。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.494,
            0.54,
            0.51
          ],
          "content": "本书解答了多个经常问到的有关 C++ 语言的问题。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.513,
            0.945,
            0.546
          ],
          "content": "- Josuttis, Nicolai M. The C++ Standard Library: A Tutorial and Reference (C++标准库教程和参考手册)。Reading. MA: Addison-Wesley, 1999。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.549,
            0.847,
            0.565
          ],
          "content": "本书介绍了标准模板库（STL）以及其他 C++ 库特性，如复数支持、区域和输入/输出流。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.568,
            0.94,
            0.602
          ],
          "content": "- Karlsson, Björn. Beyond the C++ Standard Library: An Introduction to Boost. Upper Saddle River, NJ: Addison-Wesley, 2006."
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.604,
            0.429,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": "顾名思义，本书探讨多个 Boost 库。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.623,
            0.936,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": "- Meyers, Scott. Effective C++: 55 Specific Ways to Improve Your Programs and Designs, Third Edition. Upper Saddle River, NJ: Addison-Wesley, 2005."
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.659,
            0.945,
            0.694
          ],
          "content": "本书针对的是了解 C++ 的程序员，提供了 55 条规定和指南。其中一些是技术性的，如解释何时应定义复制构造函数和赋值运算符；其他一些更为通用，如对 is-a 和 has-a 关系的讨论。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.697,
            0.936,
            0.731
          ],
          "content": "- Meyers, Scott. Effective STL: 50 Specific Ways to Improve Your Use of the Stadard Template Library. Reading, MA: Addison-Wesley, 2001."
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.733,
            0.69,
            0.749
          ],
          "content": "本书提供了选择容器和算法的指南，并讨论了使用 STL 的其他方面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.752,
            0.934,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": "- Meyers, Scott. More Effective C++: 35 New Ways to Improve Your Programs and Designs. Reading, MA: Addison-Wesley, 1996."
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.788,
            0.945,
            0.822
          ],
          "content": "本书秉承了《Effective C++》的传统，对语言中的一些较模糊的问题进行了解释，介绍了实现各种目标的方法，如设计智能指针，并反映了C++程序员在过去几年中获得的其他一些经验。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.826,
            0.945,
            0.877
          ],
          "content": "- Musser, David R, Gillmer J. Derge, and Atul Saini. STL Tutorial and Reference Guide: C++ Programming with the Standard Template Library, Second Edition. Reading, MA: Addison-Wesley, 2001. 要介绍并演示 STL 的功能，需要一整本书；该书可满足您的需求。"
        },
        {
          "type": "ref_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.881,
            0.945,
            0.916
          ],
          "content": "- Stroustrup, Bjarne. The C++ Programming Language. Third Edition. Reading, MA: Addison-Wesley, 1997.\nStroustrup 创建了 C++, 因此这是一部权威作品。不过，如果对 C++有一定的了解，将可以很容易地掌"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
